  <link:footnoteLink xlink:type="extended" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/link">
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HHFD36822F40BD77A9FE3F9C41C45DC5E1" xlink:label="HHFD36822F40BD77A9FE3F9C41C45DC5E1" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HH15DCD7E54C452194BC55DC331C07776C" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>
          <span style="text-decoration: underline;">
            <strong>Schedule 122a, line 8, column F&#160;</strong>
          </span>
        </p>
        <p>On April 30, 2026 ISO New England Inc. closed on the loan obligation with interest cap rate of 6.25% and floor rate of 3.619% equal to the product of 0.86 times the sum of Term SOFR plus 1.25%. The fair market value of the interest rate cap as of June 30, 2026 was $330,444 and is recorded in Account 176 Derivative Assets - Hedges with a concurrent charge to Account 219 Accumulated Other Comprehensive Income. The fair market value is derived from propriety models.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHFD36822F40BD77A9FE3F9C41C45DC5E1" xlink:to="HH15DCD7E54C452194BC55DC331C07776C" order="1" />
  </link:footnoteLink>
</xbrli:xbrl>